* ============================================================
* SIMULATION L7805CV — Alimentation 5V Regulee
* Task 1 — Assane DIENG — CNAM / STMicroelectronics
* LTSpice XVII
* ============================================================

* === MODELE L7805CV (STMicroelectronics) ===
.SUBCKT L7805CV IN GND OUT
* Modele simplifie regulateur lineaire 5V
* Rth_jc = 5 C/W, Rth_ja = 50 C/W
R_dropout IN OUT_INT 2
E_reg OUT GND OUT_INT GND 1
V_ref OUT_INT GND 5
R_out OUT OUT_INT 0.1
C_int OUT GND 10n
.ENDS L7805CV

* === SOURCES ===
* Source d'entree avec ondulation 100Hz (redressement)
Vin IN 0 DC 12 AC 1 SIN(12 0.5 100)
* Charge variable (resistive)
Rload VOUT 0 10

* === COMPOSANTS ===
* U1 — Regulateur L7805CV
XU1 IN 0 VOUT L7805CV

* C1 — 100uF electrolytique entree
C1 IN 0 100u IC=0

* C2 — 330nF ceramique bypass
C2 IN 0 330n

* C3 — 10uF electrolytique sortie
C3 VOUT 0 10u IC=0

* R1 — Resistance LED 150 ohm
R1 VOUT LED_A 150

* D1 — LED verte (Vf=2V)
D1 LED_A 0 DLED
.MODEL DLED D(Is=1e-15 N=1.5 Vfwd=2.0)

* === SIMULATIONS ===

* --- 1. DC SWEEP : Vout en fonction de Vin ---
* Verifier que Vout = 5V pour Vin de 7V a 35V
.DC Vin 7 35 0.1

* --- 2. TRANSIENT : Ondulation et reponse en charge ---
* Simulation sur 100ms pour voir 10 cycles a 100Hz
.TRAN 0.1m 100m 0 0.01m

* --- 3. AC : Reponse en frequence ---
.AC DEC 100 1 10MEG

* === MESURES AUTOMATIQUES ===
.MEAS DC Vout_nominal FIND V(VOUT) AT 12
.MEAS DC Vout_min FIND V(VOUT) AT 7
.MEAS DC Vout_max FIND V(VOUT) AT 35
.MEAS TRAN Vripple PP V(VOUT)
.MEAS TRAN Iload_avg AVG I(Rload)

.END
